    "description": "API - SF-501 - Account, Opportunity, Role consolidation\n\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nGenerated: 2026-01-18\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\nSUMMARY:\n  Account, Opportunity, Role consolidation\n\nDESCRIPTION:\n  As a Product Owner / Data Owner I want the Account Contact Relationship field \n  Account Contact Relationship Currency hidden, the Account Contact Relationship \n  field Relationship_Strength__c removed, and the Roles picklist value Other \n  removed (with help text added to guide users how to request a new role) So \n  that the UI is cleaner, obsolete fields are removed, and users have clear \n  guidance when the available Roles do not apply.\n\nACCEPTANCE CRITERIA:\n  1. Relationship_Strength__c field DELETED from AccountContactRelation (should NOT exist)\n  2. Roles picklist does NOT contain \"Other\" value\n  3. Account Contact Relationship Currency field hidden (may exist but not accessible)\n  4. AccountContactRelation can still be created/queried without deleted fields\n\nAPI TESTING REQUIREMENTS:\n  - Verify Relationship_Strength__c does NOT exist on AccountContactRelation\n  - Verify attempts to query/use Relationship_Strength__c fail\n  - Verify Roles field exists and picklist values\n  - Verify \"Other\" is NOT in Roles picklist\n  - Verify AccountContactRelation can be created/queried\n  - Verify Account Contact Relationship Currency field accessibility\n\nGenerated from: src/features/api/SF/SF-501.feature\n\nThis collection contains API tests for SF-501 work item.\n\n**Note:** Relationship_Strength__c should be DELETED (not exist). Roles picklist should NOT contain \"Other\".",
